  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6012.01 Compliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6012.01 Compliance.\n\n(a) All lightning rod salespeople, dealers, manufacturers, and agents shall comply with the requirements of RSA 323 and Saf-C 6012.\n\n(b) All persons designing, installing, testing, modifying, repairing, or maintaining lightning protection equipment shall comply with the requirements of NFPA 780, “Standard for the Installation of Lightning Protection Devices”, 2014 edition, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6000.html"
